  "job_A3.11_20251003_114207": {
    "chunk_text": "w\u00e6s ond mid Exsyringum, mid Ebreum ond mid Indeum ond mid Egyptum. Mid Moidum ic w\u00e6s ond mid Persum ond mid Myrgingum, ond Mofdingum ond ongend Myrgingum, Mid East\u00feyringum ic w\u00e6s ond mid Eolum ond mid Istum ond Idumingum. Ond ic w\u00e6s mid Eormanrice ealle \u00ferage, \u00fe\u00e6r me Gotena cyning gode dohte. Se me beag forgeaf, burgwarena fruma, on \u00feam siex hund w\u00e6s sm\u00e6tes goldes, gescyred sceatta \u00deone ic Eadgilse on \u00e6ht sealde, minum hleodryhtne, \u00fea ic to ham bicwom, leofum to leane, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he Ond me \u00fea Ealhhild o\u00feerne forgeaf, dryhtcwen dugu\u00fee, dohtor Eadwines. Hyre lof lengde geond londa fela, \u00feonne ic be songe secgan sceolde hw\u00e6r ic under swegle selast wisse \u00d0onne wit Scilling sciran reorde for uncrum sigedryhtne song ahofan, hlude bi hearpan hleo\u00feor \u00d0onan ic ealne geondhwearf e\u00feel Gotena, sohte ic a gesi\u00fea \u00fea selestan; \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s innweorud He\u00f0can sohte ic ond Beadecan ond Herelingas, Emercan sohte ic ond Fridlan ond Eastgotan, frodne Seccan sohte ic ond Beccan, Seafolan ond \u00feeodric, Hea\u00feoric ond Sifecan, Hli\u00fee ond Incgen\u00feeow. Eadwine sohte ic ond Elsan, \u00e6gelmund ond Hungar, ond \u00fea wloncan gedryht Wi\u00femyrginga. Wulfhere sohte ic ond Wyrmhere; ful oft \u00fe\u00e6r wig ne al\u00e6g, \u00feonne Hr",
